Package: idlescreen-studio
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Depends: idle-studio (>= 0.3.3), render (>= 0.3.3)
Recommends: idle-savers
Maintainer: IdleScreen <jerydleuck@gmail.com>
Description: IdleScreen Studio product metapackage (offline render Director)
 Pulls in idle-studio (TUI Director) and render (export binary).
 .
 Install:  sudo apt install idlescreen-studio
 Remove:   sudo apt remove idlescreen-studio
 .
 Removing this package also removes idle-studio and render.
